  "description": "Turns keyword mentions in Umbraco rich text into links to the corresponding page, at render time, with no editor action required. Stored markup is never modified, so an article picks up a link the day somebody adds the keyword. Keywords live in a backoffice section of their own rather than on your document types, and point at a page or an external URL through Umbraco's Multi URL Picker. Shows which pages carry links and lets individual ones be switched off. Multilingual.",
  "iconFile": "AutolinkLogo.png",
